(@ENTRY,0,3, 'Most of this stuff is beads and hides. Where\'s all the treasure?',12,0,50,1,0,0, 'say Text'),
(@ENTRY,0,4, 'Time is wasting. I want this place picked cleaned before they counter-attack',12,0,50,1,0,0, 'say Text'),
(@ENTRY,0,5, 'Has anyone seen the quilboar they had caged up over here?',12,0,50,1,0,0, 'say Text'),
(@ENTRY,0,6, 'Have we cleaned out the inn yet? Burn the rest of it when you\'re done!',12,0,50,1,0,0, 'say Text'),
